  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Multilateral Partnerships for Economic Development (AMPED) - Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment aims to contribute to inclusive economic growth in the Philippines by supporting economic development-related activities of key multilateral financial institutions (MFIs). Australia&apos;s aid investment is expected to leverage larger MFI resources to positively support Philippine Government development policies.  AMPED provides a mechanism for Australia to respond quickly to partner government&#x2019;s requests, that align with Australia&#x2019;s strategic objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
